193| * populated with real data rather than a single default row. Stored rows
194| * follow the arrival-vs-outcome contract: arrival rows (Moved/Advanced)
195| * record stage = destination with duration = time in the source stage, while
196| * outcome rows (Failed/Completed) record stage = source with duration = time
