309| * MARK: _entryBoundary
310| * @description Reads a timeline entry's explicit commit range back into
311| *   start/end SHA strings. Returns nulls when either side is missing or
312| *   invalid so callers can distinguish complete (both), partial (one), and
313| *   legacy (none) boundary data. The canonical fields are
314| *   `boundaryStartSha`/`boundaryEndSha`; `baseSha`/`headSha` are accepted as
