375|// Per-task serialization of the deferred diff-stat backfill, so rapid
376|// transitions (enter → fail within milliseconds) measure and attribute in
377|// call order instead of racing git against each other. A WeakMap keeps the
378|// chain off the task object itself (tasks are broadcast/serialized).
379|const _diffStatQueues = new WeakMap();
