640| * @description Assembles discrete task prompts containing the task goal, stage instructions,
641| * target report markdown path, optional prior reports or failure/feedback details,
642| * and performs dynamic keyword template substitution. When a stage declares `skills`
643| * (see api/skills/), curated prompts also carry the direct-injected skill bodies and/or
