650| *   Verification Guidance` for review/spec stages (legacy behaviour) and
651| *   auto-re-injected for verdict-expecting agent stages whose custom layout
652| *   omits `{{testingGuidance}}`, so test verification cannot be silently cut.
653| * @example TESTING_GUIDANCE_TEXT.startsWith('Unit/integration tests') => true
654| ***/
655|const TESTING_GUIDANCE_TEXT =
656|	"Unit/integration tests (`npm run test:unit`) and existing automated test suites are the primary verification gate. When visual verification is needed, do not spawn long-lived background servers — use isolated headless test runners, existing mock fixtures, or the headless screenshot tool (`npm run capture:screenshot`).";
