663| *   verdict. Shared by the engine render path and the dry-run endpoint so
664| *   the preview can never disagree with dispatch.
665| * @example resolveAutoReinjectedTokens([], { hasFailureDetails: true, stage: { type: 'agent' } }) => ['failureDetails', 'testingGuidance']
