896|	 * while omitting historical trace clutter and dynamically interpolating runtime keyword templates.
897|	 * @example const prompt = engine.curatePrompt(task, stage, { failureDetails: 'Test failed' })
898|	 * @param {Object} task - The task definition.
899|	 * @param {Object} stage - The current stage definition.
900|	 * @param {Object|string} [options=null] - Optional failure details or options object.
